# Lesson 18 – Segmentation

## Key Concepts
- KPI vs Driver Metric vs Segment
- Why averages can hide root causes
- Business-first investigation framework

## Common Segments
- Customer size
- Geography
- Product
- Customer tenure
- Acquisition channel
- Usage
- Industry

## Interview Takeaway

When aggregate metrics don't explain a business problem, segment the data before forming conclusions.

## Business Framework

1. Clarify the metric.
2. Validate the data.
3. Identify the KPI driver.
4. Segment the affected population.
5. Form hypotheses.
6. Recommend actions.

## Biggest Lesson

Segmentation transforms descriptive analytics into actionable insights.